1
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:21,240
System call.

2
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,060
Generate Luminous Element.

3
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:32,610
it.

4
00:00:32,693 --> 00:00:33,617
Wow, look at all this stuff.

5
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:36,237
Hurry, let's find our
swords and get out of here.

6
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:37,260
There They are?

7
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:55,046
I can leave the room if
you two need a minute.

8
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:56,870
Sorry.

9
00:00:58,120 --> 00:00:59,320
I don't get it.

10
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:03,717
I thought the Integrity Knights were
enough to stop the forces of darkness.

11
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,840
Is the church building an army?

12
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:08,180
It's not that.

13
00:01:08,540 --> 00:01:10,128
It's the opposite, in fact.

14
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:13,837
The church brought all this here
to make sure no one builds one.

15
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:16,500
What would be the point of that? Simple.

16
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:19,537
The church doesn't want
people rising up against it.

17
00:01:19,620 --> 00:01:22,520
Or, to be more specific,
administrator doesn't.

18
00:01:24,420 --> 00:01:25,997
Come on, let's get out of here.

19
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:27,021
Time's a-wasted.

20
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:30,000
Yeah, right. I'm coming.

21
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:34,377
Maybe we should take some armor.

22
00:01:34,460 --> 00:01:35,519
What do you think?

23
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:39,277
We never fought in it before,
so it might slow us down.

24
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:41,713
It's better if we stick to what we know.

25
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:44,748
We could use a fresh
set of clothes, though.

26
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:49,117
Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah. Awful. Awful.

27
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,277
Awful.

28
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:52,080
Awful. Awful.

29
00:02:58,580 --> 00:02:59,980
Awful.

30
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,597
Thank

31
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:19,997
you

32
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:27,080
so

33
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:30,150
much for watching.

34
00:03:30,233 --> 00:03:31,480
Help! Help!

35
00:03:48,980 --> 00:03:50,120
First element!

36
00:03:55,780 --> 00:03:57,120
Charge him!

37
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,260
Futile.

38
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:19,640
Kirito! You hit?

39
00:04:22,300 --> 00:04:24,400
No. I'm good.

40
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:26,360
That was way too close.

41
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:27,950
Huh.

42
00:04:34,420 --> 00:04:35,420
Let's go.

43
00:04:35,740 --> 00:04:36,920
System call.

44
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:47,020
Uh-oh, not good.

45
00:04:47,380 --> 00:04:48,860
That's no typical spell.

46
00:04:49,140 --> 00:04:50,880
It's perfect weapon control.

47
00:04:51,540 --> 00:04:53,320
Enhance armament.

48
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:16,700
That bow's awesome!

49
00:05:17,020 --> 00:05:19,500
Holy hell, I wonder what it was before.

50
00:05:19,900 --> 00:05:22,076
We have bigger things to worry about.

51
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:27,160
I last bathed in the Conflagration
Bow's fire two years ago.

52
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:31,920
Now I summon the fire again
to deal with you sinners.

53
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:38,060
You have the skills to match Sir Eldrie,
but what you did to him is unforgivable.

54
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:41,348
Instead of fighting
like knights with honor,

55
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:46,620
you corrupted his mind and led him
astray with the Dark Arts. What?

56
00:05:46,820 --> 00:05:48,117
It was nothing like that.

57
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:49,137
You're wrong, Sir Knight.

58
00:05:49,220 --> 00:05:52,985
All we did was remind him of his
life before he became a knight.

59
00:05:53,220 --> 00:05:55,060
What are you babbling about?

60
00:05:55,380 --> 00:05:57,360
We knights do not have a past.

61
00:05:57,580 --> 00:06:00,140
We have always been Integrity Knights.

62
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:04,071
Our existence begins when we
are summoned from the heavens.

63
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:11,280
I should burn you criminals to ash,
but my orders are to capture you alive.

64
00:06:12,020 --> 00:06:15,196
Unfortunately, I have unleashed
the conflagration bow.

65
00:06:15,700 --> 00:06:19,120
Oh, now one of your arms will
most likely be incinerated.

66
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:29,920
That bow's gonna do serious damage now.

67
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,340
Any ideas?

68
00:06:31,860 --> 00:06:34,680
I got a feeling you can't
rapid fire with that.

69
00:06:34,940 --> 00:06:38,116
If I'm lucky and block the
first shot, you charge him.

70
00:06:38,320 --> 00:06:39,820
That's not reassuring.

71
00:06:49,180 --> 00:06:50,380
I'm ready.

72
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:05,460
System call!

73
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,400
Generate cryogenic elements!

74
00:07:10,060 --> 00:07:11,000
Disharge!

75
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:15,870
Cool.

76
00:07:45,160 --> 00:08:05,316
Whoa!

77
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:10,380
Whoa! Here he go!

78
00:08:12,980 --> 00:08:14,477
Now's your chance!

79
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:15,400
Go get him!

80
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:26,000
Do not toy with me!

81
00:08:30,660 --> 00:08:31,580
Now what?

82
00:08:33,380 --> 00:08:37,145
You have to think about what
you're putting behind your strikes.

83
00:08:38,300 --> 00:08:41,157
What do you think I should
put behind mine, then?

84
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:44,652
That's something you're gonna
have to figure out yourself.

85
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:56,790
That's it.

86
00:08:57,100 --> 00:08:58,453
She's all that matters.

87
00:08:58,900 --> 00:09:01,500
I'm here for her, and
nothing will stop me.

88
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:06,260
Blue Rose Sword, lend me your power.

89
00:09:07,700 --> 00:09:10,600
Please, give me the
strength to keep going.

90
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:39,180
Please, you're cold and sharp.

91
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:44,280
Forge since creation by freezing cold
blizzards at the top of the End Mountains.

92
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:47,597
You can't let these

93
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:51,560
weak flames melt you now!

94
00:10:14,700 --> 00:10:16,520
You're finished!

95
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:14,540
The End

96
00:11:15,100 --> 00:11:17,597
skill you used, what was it?

97
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:19,400
It's of the Aincrad style.

98
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,800
A two-hit strike.

99
00:11:21,260 --> 00:11:22,140
Vertical arc.

100
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,580
A two-hit

101
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,190
strike.

102
00:11:26,273 --> 00:11:29,140
And you, what was your skill?

103
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:32,100
Kirito, are you okay? Yeah, I'm good.

104
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:33,540
I healed the worst

105
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,070
burns myself.

106
00:11:35,153 --> 00:11:36,180
What's my skill?

107
00:11:36,380 --> 00:11:37,660
It's Aincrad too.

108
00:11:38,100 --> 00:11:39,537
One of the defense skills.

109
00:11:39,620 --> 00:11:40,796
It's called spinning

110
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:47,677
Shield I thought I had
seen it all I have been

111
00:11:47,760 --> 00:11:51,197
from one end of this realm
to the other and beyond.

112
00:11:51,280 --> 00:11:55,437
And yet there are styles
I've never seen and

113
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:59,717
skills I've never encountered
I can tell there is

114
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:03,317
much discipline in you
and you have spent years

115
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:07,940
of training in your style
earlier I accused you

116
00:12:08,500 --> 00:12:11,147
of using the Dark Arts
to corrupt Ser Eldrie.

117
00:12:11,580 --> 00:12:14,777
I know now that I was mistaken.

118
00:12:14,860 --> 00:12:15,860
I would be

119
00:12:17,180 --> 00:12:18,657
honored to know your names.

120
00:12:18,740 --> 00:12:22,280
I am Eugeo, the Swordsman,
Kirito the Swordsman.

121
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:32,540
On the 50th floor, in the Great Hall of
Ghostly Light, Integrity Knights wait.

122
00:12:32,860 --> 00:12:33,920
Should you pass

123
00:12:34,560 --> 00:12:35,390
me.

124
00:12:35,473 --> 00:12:37,080
They will not take you prisoner.

125
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:40,780
They have orders to
extinguish your lives instead.

126
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:44,940
If you charge them head-on
like you did me just now,

127
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:47,580
you will most certainly meet your end.

128
00:12:47,980 --> 00:12:49,500
Whoa, hang on a sec.

129
00:12:49,860 --> 00:12:50,880
Why tell us?

130
00:12:51,100 --> 00:12:52,394
Whose side are you on?

131
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:56,360
I failed to carry out
Administrator's order.

132
00:12:56,840 --> 00:13:02,060
I shall be stripped of my armor and
divine object, the proof of my knighthood,

133
00:13:02,980 --> 00:13:05,140
then I shall be frozen for eternity.

134
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:09,260
I do not wish to suffer the indignity.

135
00:13:09,860 --> 00:13:14,260
Therefore, I want you to end my life.

136
00:13:15,620 --> 00:13:17,940
There is no need to hesitate.

137
00:13:18,700 --> 00:13:22,940
After all, you defeated me fairly,
using your splendid skills.

138
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:28,860
By the way, my name is
Tiese Elbert Synthesis 7.

139
00:13:39,420 --> 00:13:40,655
You're...Deus Albert?

140
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,070
Uh...

141
00:13:46,153 --> 00:13:49,960
Yu-Gi-Oh, you're the one who took her.

142
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:05,317
A fair battle dignity you
want to die with honor

143
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:11,617
do you do you where was
your honor when you chained

144
00:14:11,700 --> 00:14:15,277
up an 11 year old girl you
tied her to your dragon

145
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:19,100
and took her away dying
with honor is too good?

146
00:14:33,700 --> 00:14:35,060
I'm right.

147
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:37,240
I am, aren't I?

148
00:14:37,700 --> 00:14:39,200
You heard what he said.

149
00:14:39,460 --> 00:14:41,166
He's not going to fight back.

150
00:14:41,260 --> 00:14:43,380
You don't kill a defenseless person.

151
00:14:46,380 --> 00:14:50,620
I know, but he came to my
village and took Alice!

152
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:05,537
You know the church messes
with these guys' heads.

153
00:15:05,620 --> 00:15:09,340
I doubt he remembers being in
Rulid or taking Alice away.

154
00:15:10,880 --> 00:15:12,240
It's true, ain't it?

155
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:13,998
You don't remember.

156
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:23,600
It is as your companion says.

157
00:15:23,980 --> 00:15:25,340
I am a knight.

158
00:15:25,740 --> 00:15:26,760
I protect.

159
00:15:27,140 --> 00:15:31,460
I would never kidnap a child,
much less chain them to my dragon.

160
00:15:32,140 --> 00:15:34,580
If I did, I do not remember.

161
00:15:34,940 --> 00:15:36,528
What are you talking about?

162
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:39,060
It happened eight years ago!

163
00:15:39,420 --> 00:15:40,250
Old man.

164
00:15:40,333 --> 00:15:42,400
I mean, Tiese Elbert.

165
00:15:43,100 --> 00:15:47,240
Eight years ago, you were guarding
the border of North Norlinggarth.

166
00:15:47,700 --> 00:15:49,180
Do you remember that?

167
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:51,190
I do.

168
00:15:51,273 --> 00:15:53,580
District 7 in North Norlinggarth was mine.

169
00:15:54,040 --> 00:15:56,240
I used to patrol the borderlands.

170
00:15:57,140 --> 00:15:59,140
That is, until eight years ago.

171
00:15:59,860 --> 00:16:03,660
For some reason, the church rewarded me.

172
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:09,197
I received this armor and was given the
duty to guard the Central Cathedral.

173
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:12,500
Do you remember what the
church rewarded you for?

174
00:16:14,780 --> 00:16:16,480
I'll tell you why you don't.

175
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:19,520
You were on a mission to steal his friend.

176
00:16:19,860 --> 00:16:22,200
She's called Alice Synthesis 30 now.

177
00:16:22,620 --> 00:16:26,897
As soon as you brought her back here,
Administrator rewarded you alright.

178
00:16:26,980 --> 00:16:29,600
She also erased your
memory of what you did,

179
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:32,277
because she can't have
you remembering her.

180
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:35,877
You told us before that
Integrity Knights have no past.

181
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:39,960
Your lives begin when you're summoned
from heaven, but that's a lie.

182
00:16:40,180 --> 00:16:44,827
That's something the Pontifex tells all
the knights, right after they come too.

183
00:16:44,920 --> 00:16:45,920
And you know why?

184
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:48,897
To help explain why
none of you can remember

185
00:16:48,980 --> 00:16:51,627
anything before becoming
an Integrity Knight.

186
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:54,911
She doesn't want you to have any memories.

187
00:16:55,460 --> 00:16:56,600
Not even one.

188
00:16:56,880 --> 00:17:00,077
And she doesn't stop with the
memories of your human life.

189
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:03,042
She takes the ones you
have of other knights too.

190
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:05,711
The ones you brought to her to get turned.

191
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:08,537
If a sinner you brought
in for judgment showed up

192
00:17:08,620 --> 00:17:11,057
as a knight the next day
and you remembered them,

193
00:17:11,140 --> 00:17:12,260
there'd be chaos.

194
00:17:13,100 --> 00:17:15,600
But I would remember. I would.

195
00:17:16,380 --> 00:17:19,500
Like I said, Administrator
stole your memories.

196
00:17:20,060 --> 00:17:22,940
And then, she forced
absolute loyalty on you.

197
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:25,480
Then she turned you into a knight.

198
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:28,240
But you're human, just like us.

199
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:30,350
Human?

200
00:17:30,433 --> 00:17:32,440
And having my memory manipulated?

201
00:17:33,340 --> 00:17:34,820
By the Pontifex?

202
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:38,960
Impossible. Absurd. No, boy.

203
00:17:40,020 --> 00:17:42,280
You are the one who is mistaken here.

204
00:17:42,820 --> 00:17:44,702
Look, try to remember something.

205
00:17:45,080 --> 00:17:46,200
Anything at all.

206
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:48,911
I bet there's an image or a feeling there.

207
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:52,500
Something so precious to
you, no art can erase it.

208
00:17:55,080 --> 00:17:59,500
From the time I first ascended,
I keep having the same dream.

209
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:05,620
A delicate hand shaking me awake,
and on one finger, a silver ring.

210
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:16,440
And when I do wake up,
there's no one there.

211
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:22,760
Whoever that hand belongs to
is someone special to you.

212
00:18:23,540 --> 00:18:25,834
Administrator stole your memory of him.

213
00:18:26,180 --> 00:18:28,200
What you do next is up to you.

214
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:32,457
You can go back to Administrator
and accept your punishment.

215
00:18:32,540 --> 00:18:35,300
Or you can heal yourself
and come after us.

216
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:36,960
Your call

217
00:19:10,140 --> 00:19:11,337
All these stairs.

218
00:19:11,420 --> 00:19:13,080
How far up are we now?

219
00:19:13,940 --> 00:19:15,657
The next floor is the 29th.

220
00:19:15,740 --> 00:19:19,740
At the rate we're going, we'll reach
the 50th floor in half an hour.

221
00:19:20,020 --> 00:19:21,500
Should we just charge in?

222
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:25,960
Good question.

223
00:19:29,540 --> 00:19:30,952
You think of everything.

224
00:19:37,900 --> 00:19:40,997
After seeing how that last
dude fought, I got a theory.

225
00:19:41,080 --> 00:19:43,786
Combo attacks seem to
throw these knights off.

226
00:19:43,960 --> 00:19:46,842
It's like they never had
a deal with them before.

227
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:51,340
If it's one-on-one and we could get
up close, I think we'd have a chance.

228
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:55,097
But that knight said there's a bunch
up there and they're ready for us.

229
00:19:55,180 --> 00:19:57,037
That's gonna make things harder.

230
00:19:57,120 --> 00:19:57,950
You're right.

231
00:19:58,160 --> 00:19:59,757
Perhaps we should avoid them.

232
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:01,016
Find another way up.

233
00:20:01,420 --> 00:20:03,480
Yeah, I don't know about that.

234
00:20:04,300 --> 00:20:06,817
Cardinal said these stairs
were the only way up,

235
00:20:06,900 --> 00:20:09,017
so we're gonna have to deal with them.

236
00:20:09,100 --> 00:20:13,688
Even if we did find a way around, we'd
have to face them on the way back down.

237
00:20:13,820 --> 00:20:15,797
We should deal with those knights now.

238
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:17,880
Our new special skill should help.

239
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:19,230
That's right.

240
00:20:19,420 --> 00:20:20,773
Perfect weapon control.

241
00:20:21,800 --> 00:20:22,630
Yup.

242
00:20:22,713 --> 00:20:27,061
Maybe if we use it when we charge in, we
can take a bunch out before they can react.

243
00:20:27,300 --> 00:20:30,241
With any luck, our first
strike will get them all.

244
00:20:30,940 --> 00:20:33,160
Actually, we should talk about that.

245
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:35,282
I don't think I'll be much help.

246
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:38,277
My version of perfect
weapon control isn't a

247
00:20:38,360 --> 00:20:41,066
direct attack like that
Integrity Knights was.

248
00:20:41,460 --> 00:20:42,290
What?

249
00:20:42,373 --> 00:20:43,203
You're kidding.

250
00:20:43,286 --> 00:20:44,116
Uh-uh.

251
00:20:44,199 --> 00:20:46,857
Not based on the command
Cardinal wrote for me.

252
00:20:46,940 --> 00:20:50,880
I mean, I guess in the end
it's my fault for imagining it.

253
00:20:51,160 --> 00:20:54,940
Well, let me check it out and
see what's up with it. Okay.

254
00:21:00,300 --> 00:21:01,418
Yeah, you're right.

255
00:21:01,660 --> 00:21:04,657
It might not be quick enough
for a surprise attack.

256
00:21:04,740 --> 00:21:07,897
Still, it should come in handy
as long as you use it right.

257
00:21:07,980 --> 00:21:11,117
Plus, it looks like it complements
my perfect control art.

258
00:21:11,200 --> 00:21:12,030
Really?

259
00:21:12,113 --> 00:21:13,746
Can I see what yours is like?

260
00:21:14,020 --> 00:21:16,373
Nah, I don't want to spoil the surprise.

261
00:21:22,140 --> 00:21:23,081
